  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Furious after self Gu bites it, wisdom Gu comes to lie Gu asking for help taking revenge. Lie Gu asks how it can help, and wisdom Gu lays out a simple deception: Ren Zu and his children are in Primordial Domain, with Xi Land ahead and Hu Land behind, so lie Gu need only tell Ren Zu the reverse. Lie Gu is puzzled that this could serve as revenge, and wisdom Gu laughs that breathing in comes before breathing out, since Xi Land and Hu Land are heaven and earth’s own breath. Lie Gu follows the plan into Primordial Domain and warns Ren Zu to be careful, telling him he will reach Hu Land by going forward and Xi Land by moving back. Remembering the beastmen’s old warning against Hu Land, Ren Zu deliberately turns back with Great Strength True Martial and Carefree Wisdom Heart, and the three arrive in Hu Land instead, deceived exactly as wisdom Gu intended.",
        "chapters": [
          2184
        ],
